### Match Statement-Expression Consistency

#### expression and statement match get same answers

- Verify: expression and statement match get same answers


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 7 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: expression and statement match get same answers")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val expr_val = match 42:
    42 => "found_expr"
    _ => "other_expr"
expect expr_val == "found_expr"
expect match_side_effect(0) == "zero"
```

</details>

